Common Type StudentObjectiveAssessment
    documentation 'This entity holds the score and or performance levels earned for an ObjectiveAssessment 
                  'by a student.
    include ScoreResult
        documentation 'A meaningful score or statistical expression of the performance of an 
                      'individual. The results can be expressed as a number, percentile, range, level, 
                      'etc.
        is required collection
    include PerformanceLevel
        documentation 'The PerformanceLevel(s) achieved for the ObjectiveAssessment.
        is optional collection
    reference ObjectiveAssessment
        documentation 'Reference to the test objective that is being measured by the objective-level 
                      'assessment.
        is part of identity